msgctxt "124"
msgid "Argh... Why didn't you guys help me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Have you seen this guy!? He ain't just some street thug. Only you'd be "
"stupid enough to pick a fight with a real beast, Minamizawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Why do I even pay you guys?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Hey, Kitagawa? I found Minamizawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "We're around West Park. You'll see us when you get here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Urgh... How am I gonna face Kitagawa now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "There's nothin' more worthless than a manzai comedian who can't manzai..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Kitagawa knows exactly how you feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Kitagawa's always wanted to do more manzai, just like you. He's been "
"looking for you all this time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... You gotta help me. Would ya play the straight man to my "
"funnyman?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"After so long outta the game, my comedy edge mighta gotten rusty. I gotta "
"sharpen up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"If I can't even hack a joke, I'll never be able to look Kitagawa in the eye "
"again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"I'm beggin' ya, man! I don't wanna run away anymore! I'm gonna get back "
"into comedy if it kills me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Please! You're my last chance to get my manzai groove back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "...Just this once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Thanks a million!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Here we go... Gimme something snappy. Reactive, know what I mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Did I ever tell you I've been training for a marathon across Japan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "You, uh... gotta be kidding me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "...Nope. No good. Your heart's not in it, buddy, you're too self-conscious!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "I don't know what you expected. I'm not an entertainer, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "How do I give a comeback to that!? I don't know any running gags!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Dayum!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Uh, how was that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"Solid! You got a solid comeback, buddy. Just needs a little more bite, some "
"more pizzazz, a little chutzpah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "So...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "Gahhh! That one stung!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"The sadistic comeback, huh...? Well, I guess that one's technically a "
"classic. Here, that brutal comeback deserves a reward."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "What the... What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Oh, well, I⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "You told me I was the only straight man you'd ever need!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Kitagawa..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"That's the only reason I've been on these stupid dramas and talk shows! I "
"don't want anyone to forget the Mars Fighters!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"All it took was a couple blogs sayin' we \"can't improv\" or our reactions "
"were \"too weak,\" and you just ran off!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"I thought... I thought you wanted to do manzai with me! And now you give up "
"after one or two schmucks heckle us!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"Kitagawa, I... I... I want to do manzai with you again! Would you be my "
"partner, just one more time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "...Stand up, Minamizawa. You'll always be my partner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Kitagawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"And so the duo's friendship turned to love... Their married-couple style "
"manzai routine gave birth to years of joyous laughter..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Why am I stuck getting married to you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Ah, craaap!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, this'll be the second time you've saved us. Thanks for "
"everythin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid ""
"Hey, we make a pretty good team... Maybe we oughta form a comedy trio! "
"Whaddaya say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "Please, no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid ""
"Hahahaha! Well, I'll head back to the office. Time to convince my agent to "
"let us get the band back together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Oh, and take this. It's the least I can do to thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Minamizawa's Autograph<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"Thanks, Kiryu-san! Watch out for us, cause the Mars Fighters are aimin' for "
"the stars! See ya round!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "You gotta be kidding me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "How do I give a comeback to that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "So...?"
msgstr ""

